  "seoBody": "<p>Many firms in Ireland already use WhatsApp for photos and voice notes. With Quickler you answer questions in that same chat. When you say done, Quickler writes the report from everything you sent. No new app to install.</p><h2>A Record first, a PDF when you need it.</h2><p>Your answers and photos become a Record. Faults are listed with their place, and each becomes a job. Send a PDF, a Word file or a web link when a client asks.</p><h2>Use the phone you already have.</h2><ul><li>Nothing to download</li><li>Answer by text, voice note or photo</li><li>Pay for each phone number on the account.</li></ul><p>Quickler asks the questions one by one. Every Record comes out complete.</p><h2>Any report you write again and again.</h2><h3>Electrical, gas, plumbing and heating</h3><p>Send us your own form. Quickler fills it in from your answers and photos.</p><h3>Fire and safety checks</h3><p>Each visit is saved. The next visit starts with the history.</p><h3>Vehicle, plant and site checks</h3><p>The same WhatsApp chat works for a van check or a site walk.</p><h2>Quickler in Ireland.</h2><h3>Do I need to install anything?</h3><p>No. You use the WhatsApp already on your phone. You pay £75 a month for each phone number on the account.</p><h3>Can it fill in my own form?</h3><p>Yes. Send us a form or a finished report, in Word or PDF. Quickler fills in that layout each time.</p><h3>Where does the data live?</h3><p>On EU servers in Germany.</p><h3>What do I get at the end?</h3><p>A Record with faults, photos and answers, and a PDF if you want one. See <a href=\"/pages/global-field-compliance.html\">Quickler worldwide</a> or <a href=\"/pages/field-compliance-software-ireland.html\">field compliance software for Ireland</a>. To start, <a href=\"/pages/help/index.html#contact-form-section\">get in touch</a>.</p>",
